&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Per Diem Medical Social Worker - Home Health&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visits to be completed weekdays, between the hours of 8:30am - 5:00pm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt; is currently seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Medical Social Worker, MSW &lt;/strong&gt;for&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;per diem&lt;/strong&gt; home care visits, &lt;strong&gt;in person &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;servicing patients in &lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Worcester, Auburn, Charlton, Uxbridge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and surrounding towns&lt;/strong&gt;. Prior home care experience is preferred, but not required. As a &lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Medical Social Worker,&lt;/strong&gt; you will be an integral member of a multi-disciplinary health care team that provides skilled nursing and rehabilitative care to clients, affording them the&amp;nbsp;opportunity to receive the medical care required to remain at home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Call or Text Susan at 339-235-4363 for Immediate Consideration!!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;iframe class=&quot;iCIMS_FrameMedia&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;&quot; src=&quot;//www.youtube.com/embed/rR0dyOyEqU8?wmode=transparent&quot; width=&quot;425&quot; height=&quot;350&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
