&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NiCE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So What is The Role About?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Manager, Solutions Architecture, &lt;/strong&gt;is responsible with managing and growing a high-performing team of AI software engineers on the NA AI Services Delivery team. This team will include a blend of AI Engineers, Software Developers, and ML/LLM specialists. You will own and drive the successful delivery of AI software engineering initiatives within defined scope, timeline, and budget. This role has you leading and guiding employees, customers and partners to design, build and implement innovative Conversational AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Manager will oversee and coordinate all aspects of AI software engineering management responsibilities internally and externally with client teams. You will be accountable for ensuring that AI software solutions are delivered on time, within budget, and in accordance with defined scope and quality standards. ​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​The primary objective of the Manager is to successfully execute with team members on all assigned AI delivery projects, achieving goals against the Statement of Work (SOW) and meeting the expectations of stakeholders by delivering through Agile/Waterfall project methodology in partnership with the PMO team.&lt;/p&gt;
