&lt;li&gt;Establishing technical best practices and engineering standards for efficient, high-quality project execution and tracking them closely with client project teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with their team members to ensure meeting project deadlines and milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage and track the project schedule effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completing tasks on time, managing dependencies, and mitigating potential delays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying, assessing, and mitigating risks with escalation management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post-project evaluations, capturing lessons learned, and implementing corrective actions or process enhancements with team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with their team members on management of action items and holding all parties accountable for their role in the success of a project.&lt;/li&gt;
