&lt;li&gt;Amazing interpersonal and communication skills and enjoy working with customers and partners and collaborating with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric, solution-oriented, and value-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, proactive and capable of structuring your work in order to deliver and help the team deliver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience is managing people and having experience in Conflict Resolution &amp;amp; Employee Relations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting clear goals and expectations for employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing motivation and guidance to enhance performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting regular performance reviews and feedback sessions with the support of PS Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying areas for improvement and offering coaching or training with the support of PS Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognizing and rewarding employee achievements with the support of PS Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing team workload and resources efficiently with the support of PS Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving change and innovation to improve team performance with the support of PS Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the planning, execution, monitoring, and control of AI software engineering projects from start to finish, ensuring adherence to engineering best practices and delivery methodologies with the engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand business requirements and translate them into technical requirements, drive this with team members across all projects.&lt;/li&gt;
