&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical expertise: deep understanding of AI/ML technologies, large language models (LLMs), software engineering best practices, cloud-native architectures, and related software development technologies​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer centricity: Solution oriented, value-driven, and navigating the interpersonal/political dynamics of customer interactions​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication and collaboration: Effective and target group-oriented communication and the ability to collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams​&lt;/li&gt;
