&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a motivated and detail-oriented CRM Specialist with hands-on experience in Microsoft Dynamics 365, particularly in on-premise and online environments. The ideal candidate will play a key role in configuring, customizing, and enhancing CRM systems to meet evolving business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position offers you the opportunity to work with public agency IT teams of Singapore and AvePoint R&amp;amp;D team to complete customer-related CRM project.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and configure Microsoft Dynamics 365 (on-premise and online) environments, including system settings, security roles, and data integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement Dynamics 365 workflows, business rules, and process automation to support business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop custom CRM plugins and perform form customizations using JavaScript and Dynamics 365 SDK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Business Analysts and stakeholders to gather requirements, propose CRM-based solutions, and support workshops and solution reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with remote R&amp;amp;D teams to troubleshoot and resolve CRM-related incidents and technical issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate Dynamics 365 with external systems via WebAPI and SFTP, with considerations for authentication, authorization, and encryption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize CI/CD pipelines and implement secure coding practices in CRM solution deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and skills that we are looking for include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;624&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;124&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;499&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3-5 years&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;124&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Profile&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;499&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Dynamics 365 CRM plugin development and form customization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in configuring both on-premise and online Dynamics 365 workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Front-end development experience using React, JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid database knowledge, including SQL Server, MySQL, and PostgreSQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with WebAPI standards, security protocols, and integration techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SFTP-based system integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and troubleshooting skills, especially in CRM environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and self-motivated team player, capable of working independently and under tight timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and interpersonal skills, with a collaborative and consultative approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, organized, and committed to delivering high-quality solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education:&amp;nbsp;Bachelor&#39;s&amp;nbsp;degree&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Any personal data you share with us during the application process will be processed strictly in compliance with applicable data protection laws and our &lt;a id=&quot;menur12n&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.avepoint.com/company/privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

